       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. WIDE-EDITING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 WS-WIDE PIC S9(20).
       77 WS-NARROW PIC 99 VALUE 42.
       77 WS-EDITED PIC -Z(32)9.99.
       77 WS-NARROW-EDIT PIC Z(37)9.
       77 WS-AFTER PIC X VALUE "!".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE -12345678901234567890 TO WS-WIDE.
           MOVE WS-WIDE TO WS-EDITED.
           DISPLAY "WIDE=[" WS-EDITED "]" WS-AFTER.
           MOVE WS-NARROW TO WS-EDITED.
           DISPLAY "NARROW=[" WS-EDITED "]" WS-AFTER.
           MOVE WS-NARROW TO WS-NARROW-EDIT.
           DISPLAY "LARGE-NARROW=[" WS-NARROW-EDIT "]" WS-AFTER.
           STOP RUN.
